just to add a few infos to the above:
The default SV-motions are defined in the database (on the system tab) and depending on both the setting of the skill used AND whether the skill type is listed under "SV Magic" in the database.
if the tips above don't help you solve your issue, we'll need a screenshot of that as well as a screenshot of your plugin manager (some plugins override those settings)
